  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-3174142acdc31a4a3897115f",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "给定由任意 (A, B) 描述的 n 阶系统及期望的 n 阶首一特征多项式 α_c(s)：(1) 通过状态变换 x = Tz 将 (A, B) 变换为控制规范型 (A_c, B_c)；(2) 利用式 (7.87) 观察求解控制增益，给出控制律 u = -K_c z；(3) 将增益变换回原状态以得到 K = K_c T^{-1}。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Given a system of order n described by an arbitrary (A, B) and a desired nth-order monic characteristic polynomial α_c(s): (1) transform (A, B) to control canonical form (A_c, B_c) by changing the state x = Tz; (2) solve for the control gains by inspection using Eq. (7.87) to give the control law u = -K_c z; (3) transform the gain back to the original state to get K = K_c T^{-1}.",
